### stand-test KB ingestion — verbatim source stays LOCAL (never commit) ###
# The whole _source/ tree (raw binaries, converter output normalized.md, extracted media/*.emf)
# holds verbatim, un-redacted document content that may carry live hosts/credentials/PII.
# Only redacted, schema-valid candidate YAML is committed; the source is traced by document.hash.
docs/ai-agent/knowledge-base/candidates/**/_source/
knowledge-base/candidates/**/_source/
# Ad-hoc drop location for raw spec documents fed into ingestion — same rule: verbatim, never commit.
docs/source/